package protobuf

// protobuf - a full .proto schema compiler: hand-written lexer/parser/AST
// for proto3 syntax (message/enum/oneof/map/nested types/imports), an
// import-graph flattener, and a codegen pass that emits Salam source text
// (concrete structs + Marshal/Unmarshal functions) - mirroring how this
// project's own compiler is structured (compiler/token.salam, lexer.salam,
// parser.salam), since std/regex has nowhere near enough power to tokenize
// .proto. wire.salam (varint/zigzag/fixed/length-delimited over
// compress.ByteBuf/ByteReader) is the one piece every generated message
// depends on and is usable standalone.
//
// Scope: proto3 message/enum wire encoding only - gRPC service/rpc blocks
// parse but are otherwise ignored (no precedent in this codebase for
// generating RPC stubs), and proto2 (groups/extensions) is out of scope.
